#X text 20 10 sound_bank: uploaded sounds as arrays \, read once and shared. Put one [sound_bank] in main.pd. JS writes each sound as a wav on the engine disk and sends "<name> <path>" to whistle-sound-bank. This makes [array define <name>-L] and [array define <name>-R] in [pd sounds] and reads the file into them (a mono file fills only -L). Patches read them by name (placed_sound.pd: set <name>-L <name>-R).;
